# =============================================================================
#  Prince Alex TicketHub - legacy URL redirects (Cloudflare Pages)
#  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Every page now lives in its own folder (sell-your-tickets/index.html) and is
#  served at a clean folder URL (/sell-your-tickets/). These rules 301 old
#  .html links - from search engines, old emails and bookmarks - to the new
#  locations. Query strings (e.g. ?reference= on payment pages) are preserved
#  automatically by Cloudflare Pages.
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
#  Hardening: nothing under /worker or /tools is part of the public site, and
#  the dev/test harnesses must never be readable from it - several of them
#  embed or import the entire Worker source (worker/index.js, worker/worker.js)
#  and the schema. Cloudflare Pages has no 404/410 status for _redirects, so a
#  200 proxy to the homepage is used: the file is simply never handed out.
#  Rules execute in order and the first match wins, so these stay first.
# =============================================================================

